     "title": "Story 0.3 · 📬 Your Digital Post Box",
     "description": "✨ Inbox, Compose, Sent and Spam: four words that make Gmail easy.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: “Photos from Dubai”\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Fernandes\n\n👵 Mrs. Fernandes is 62 years old and lives in Goa. Her daughter works in Dubai.\n\nHer daughter calls: “Mummy, I sent you the baby’s photos by email. Please check.”\n\nMrs. Fernandes opens Gmail and finds her daughter’s email waiting in the Inbox. She opens it and smiles at the photos.\n\nShe taps Compose and writes back: “Thank you, beta. Lovely!”\n\n📱 Gmail on her phone:\n• Keeps the emails sent to you in the Inbox\n• Lets you write a new email with Compose\n• Keeps your sent emails in Sent\n\nLater she sees an email in Spam that says: “You have won ₹25 lakh!” She does not open it.\n“Good,”* she says. *“Spam is where the tricks go.”\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If a Strange Email Is in Your Inbox?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nSometimes a suspicious email reaches the Inbox too. It may say it is from a bank and ask you to tap a link.\n\nMrs. Fernandes does not tap it. She deletes it, or shows it to her daughter.\n\n💡 Do not tap links or open attachments from people you do not know.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Read your Inbox\n📱 Open Gmail. The Inbox shows the emails sent to you.\n✅ Tap an email to read it.\n\n2️⃣ Write with Compose\n✅ Tap Compose.\n✅ Type the address in To, a Subject and your message.\n✅ Tap Send.\n\n3️⃣ Look in Sent\n✅ Sent shows the emails you have sent.\n\n4️⃣ Leave Spam alone\n✅ Spam holds suspicious emails.\n✅ Do not open them or tap their links.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: “Mrs. Fernandes and the Lucky Email”\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Fernandes sees a new email saying: “You won a lottery! Tap here to claim.”\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Not tap the link\n☐ Delete the email or leave it in Spam\n☐ Ask a family member if she is unsure\n☐ Tap the link, because it is free money\n☐ Send her bank details to claim the prize\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Not tap the link\n✅ Delete the email or leave it in Spam\n✅ Ask a family member if she is unsure\n❌ Prize emails are tricks\n❌ Never send bank details by email\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Inbox Explorer Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on this:\n\n✅ You can read and write emails with confidence\n✅ You know where to find what you sent\n✅ You can spot a trick email\n✅ You stay in touch with family far away\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWho would you like to write your first email to?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
