     "title": "Story 0.4 · 🔑 The Magic Class Code",
     "description": "✨ A short code opens the door to your Digital Saathi class.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: “A Code on a Card”\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Naidu\n\n👴 Mr. Naidu is 69 years old and lives in Hyderabad. He worries that an “online class” will be too hard.\n\nKavya, a Digital Saathi volunteer, writes a short class code on a card and gives it to him.\n\n“This code is like a key,” she says. “It opens your class.”\n\nMr. Naidu opens the Classroom app and signs in with his Gmail account.\n\n📱 The Classroom app:\n• Shows all your classes on one screen\n• Keeps your lessons in one place\n• Shows the tasks your Saathi gives you\n\nHe taps the + sign, taps Join class, types the code and taps Join.\nHis class appears on the screen. *“That is all?”* he laughs. *“I thought it would be harder.”*\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If the Code Does Not Work?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nSometimes the app says the code is wrong. Often one letter or number was typed by mistake.\n\nMr. Naidu checks each letter and number against the card. If it still fails, he asks Kavya for the code again.\n\n💡 Join the class in your own language. Your Saathi will tell you which code to use.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Open Classroom and sign in\n📱 Open classroom.google.com or the Classroom app.\n✅ Sign in with your Gmail account.\n\n2️⃣ Tap the + sign\n✅ Tap the + at the top.\n✅ Tap Join class.\n\n3️⃣ Type the class code\n✅ Type the code from your Saathi, slowly.\n✅ Tap Join.\n\n4️⃣ Open your class\n✅ Your class now appears on the home screen. Tap it to open.\n✅ If you have an invite link instead, tap the link and then tap Join.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: “Help Mr. Naidu Join His Class”\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Naidu has a class code from his Saathi.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Sign in with his Gmail account\n☐ Tap the + sign and choose Join class\n☐ Type the code carefully and tap Join\n☐ Post the class code on social media\n☐ Type his Gmail password in the class-code box\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Sign in with his Gmail account\n✅ Tap the + sign and choose Join class\n✅ Type the code carefully and tap Join\n❌ Anyone could then join and see the class\n❌ That box is only for the class code\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Class Joiner Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on this:\n\n✅ You can join any Digital Saathi class\n✅ All your lessons are in one place\n✅ You are not afraid of “online classes” any more\n✅ You can help a friend join too\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWho could you help to join a class after you?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
