     "title": "Story 0.5 · ✍️ Fill It In, Press Submit",
     "description": "✨ A Google Form is just questions on a screen. Answer, then press Submit.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: “The Quiz With No Pass or Fail”\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Pawar\n\n👵 Mrs. Pawar is 58 years old and lives in Nashik. She is a housewife who loves cooking.\n\nHer Saathi sends her a link on WhatsApp: “Please fill the Pre-Assessment. It has no pass or fail.”\n\nMrs. Pawar is nervous. “What if I make a mistake?” she asks.\n\nHer Saathi smiles. “This is only to help us understand where to begin.”\n\n📱 She taps the link and her phone:\n• Opens the form in the browser\n• Lets her tap or type her answers\n• Sends her answers when she taps Submit\n\nShe reads each question slowly. When she does not know an answer, she chooses I am not sure.\nAt the bottom she taps Submit, and a message says her answer has been recorded.\n*“So simple,”* she says.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Close the Page Too Early?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Pawar once closes a form before tapping Submit. Her answers are not sent.\n\nShe simply opens the link again and starts over. It takes only a few minutes.\n\n💡 Only the Submit button sends your answers.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Tap the link\n✅ Tap the form’s link. It opens in your browser.\n✅ Some forms ask you to sign in with Gmail first.\n\n2️⃣ Read each question slowly\n✅ Tap an answer, or type your own.\n✅ If you do not know, choose I am not sure.\n\n3️⃣ Scroll to the bottom\n✅ Check that you have answered every question.\n\n4️⃣ Tap Submit\n✅ Tap Submit.\n✅ Look for the message that your answer has been recorded.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: “Help Mrs. Pawar Fill the Form”\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Pawar has opened the Pre-Assessment link.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Read each question slowly\n☐ Choose “I am not sure” when she does not know\n☐ Scroll down and tap Submit when she has finished\n☐ Close the page without tapping Submit\n☐ Type her PIN or OTP in a box\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Read each question slowly\n✅ Choose “I am not sure” when she does not know\n✅ Scroll down and tap Submit when she has finished\n❌ Her answers will not be sent\n❌ A form never needs your PIN or OTP\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Form Filler Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on this:\n\n✅ You can open and answer any Google Form\n✅ You know how to send your answers\n✅ You are not afraid of quizzes\n✅ You are ready for the Pre-Assessment\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich form would you like to fill in first?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
