     "title": "Story 0.6 · ✅ Done and Dusted",
     "description": "✨ Open a task, do it, tap Mark as done, and your Saathi can see.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: “The Little Button”\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Bose\n\n👴 Mr. Bose is 73 years old and lives in Kolkata. His grandson teases him: “Dadu, you are a student again!”\n\nMr. Bose opens his class on his phone. At the top he sees Classwork.\n\nInside he finds a task: “I finished 0.1 · Your First Email Address”.\n\nHe has already read that lesson and tried the activity on his phone. Now he taps the task to open it.\n\n📱 In his class, his phone shows:\n• Lessons to read\n• Tasks to do\n• A button to tell his Saathi that he has finished\n\nWhen he has finished, he taps Mark as done.\nThat evening his Saathi writes: *“Well done, Mr. Bose!”* He feels very proud.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Tap It by Mistake?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Bose once taps the button before he has done the task. He is worried.\n\nHe tells his Saathi, who helps him do the task properly. Nobody is angry. Learning takes time.\n\n💡 A lesson post is only for reading. A task has a button to tap when you finish.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Open your class\n✅ Open your class and tap Classwork at the top.\n\n2️⃣ Open a task\n✅ Tap a topic, then tap the task to open it.\n✅ Lessons are only for reading. Tasks are for doing.\n\n3️⃣ Do the task\n✅ Read it slowly and do what it says.\n✅ Ask a family member to sit with you if you like.\n\n4️⃣ Tap Mark as done\n✅ Tap Mark as done. If you see Turn in, tap that.\n✅ Your Saathi can now see that you finished.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: “Help Mr. Bose Finish His Task”\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Bose has read a lesson and tried its activity on his phone.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Tap Classwork and open the task\n☐ Tap Mark as done, or Turn in\n☐ Tap Stream to see new announcements\n☐ Write his Aadhaar number in the class as proof\n☐ Skip Mark as done and just tell a family member\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Tap Classwork and open the task\n✅ Tap Mark as done, or Turn in\n✅ Tap Stream to see new announcements\n❌ Never share your Aadhaar or other private numbers in the class\n❌ Your Saathi can only see it if you tap the button\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Task Finisher Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on this:\n\n✅ Your Saathi can see your progress\n✅ You know where to find your tasks\n✅ You feel proud of each task you finish\n✅ You are ready for Step 01\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich task would you like to finish first?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
    }
