     "title": "Story 1.1 · 🛡️ Your Silent Guardian",
     "description": "✨ One press for help, and your family's numbers ready on your lock screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🚨 Story: \"One Button Could Make All the Difference\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Sharma\n\n👴 Mr. Sharma is 68 years old and lives alone while his son works in another city.\n\nEvery morning, he goes for a walk in the neighbourhood park.\n\nOne day, while returning home, he feels dizzy and nearly falls.\nHe is scared, his hands are shaking, and he cannot think whom to call first.\n\nLuckily, his Android phone has Emergency SOS set up.\n\nHe presses the power button 5 times, quickly.\n\n📱 His phone can (depending on how it was set up):\n• Call for help\n• Share his location with the people he chose\n• Alert the family members saved as his emergency contacts\n\nSoon his son Rahul is on the phone, and a neighbour is on the way.\nMr. Sharma sits on a bench, safe and calm.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If Mr. Sharma Couldn't Unlock His Phone?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nImagine his hands are too shaky, or he cannot remember his PIN.\n\nA passer-by wants to help. They tap Emergency on the lock screen.\nThey can see what Mr. Sharma chose to add:\n\n• 👦 Son: Rahul Sharma, with his phone number\n• 👧 Daughter: Priya Sharma, with her phone number\n• ❤️ Blood group and other medical details\n\n💡 Only what you add is shown. Choose what you are comfortable with people seeing.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Android phone. Menu names can differ a little on your phone. Use the search box in Settings if you cannot find a name.)\n\n1️⃣ Add Emergency Contacts\n📱 Open: Settings → Safety & emergency → Emergency contacts\n\n✅ Add:\n• Son or daughter\n• Husband or wife\n• A close relative\n• A trusted neighbour or friend\n\n2️⃣ Add Medical Information\n📱 Open: Settings → Safety & emergency → Medical information\n\n✅ Add:\n• Blood group\n• Allergies\n• Medicines and health conditions\n• A short emergency note\n\n3️⃣ Turn On Emergency SOS\n📱 Open: Settings → Safety & emergency → Emergency SOS\n\n✅ Turn Emergency SOS ON\n✅ Choose what happens when it starts (the choices depend on your phone):\n• Emergency call\n• Location sharing\n• Alerts to your emergency contacts\n\n4️⃣ Know the Shortcut\n🚨 In an emergency, press the power button 5 times, quickly.\n\n📱 iPhone: Open the Health app → Medical ID.\n\n⚠️ Do not press it 5 times \"just to see\". It may really call someone. Practise only after telling your family.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Help Mr. Sharma Stay Safe\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Sharma walks alone every morning.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do before he goes out? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Add emergency contacts\n☐ Add medical information\n☐ Turn on Emergency SOS\n☐ Learn the 5-press shortcut\n☐ Switch the phone off to save battery\n☐ Delete his family's numbers so nobody sees them\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Add emergency contacts\n✅ Add medical information\n✅ Turn on Emergency SOS\n✅ Learn the 5-press shortcut\n❌ A switched-off phone cannot call for help\n❌ Deleted numbers cannot help anyone\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Safety Champion Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on these settings:\n\n✅ Family can be reached faster\n✅ Important medical details are ready for helpers\n✅ Help can be called quickly, even if you cannot unlock your phone\n✅ Mr. Sharma feels safer on his daily walks\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nIf an emergency happened today, who should appear on your lock screen as your emergency contact?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
