     "title": "Story 2.2 · 🗺️ Help Is Nearby",
     "description": "✨ Find the nearest hospital, pharmacy or bus in seconds.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Fever at Night\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Gill\n\n👵 Mrs. Gill is 63 years old and lives in Ludhiana. Her husband and she have just moved to a new colony near their son's house.\n\nOne night, her husband has a high fever.\nIt is late, and they do not know this area well.\nShe does not know where the nearest chemist is, and she does not want to wake the neighbours.\n\nThen she remembers that her son showed her Google Maps.\n\n📱 Her phone can:\n• Find the nearest hospital or pharmacy\n• Show how far it is\n• Show the way to get there\n\nShe opens Google Maps and types: “pharmacy near me.”\nA list appears. The nearest chemist is a few minutes away, and it is open.\n\nShe gets the medicine and returns home. Her husband rests comfortably.\n*“I did not have to wake anyone,”* she says.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Need a Bus?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Das, 70, lives in Kolkata and wants to go to a friend's house in another part of the city.\nHe is not sure which bus to take.\n\nHe opens Google Maps, types the place he wants to go, and taps the bus icon.\nHe sees bus routes and timings, where they are available.\n\n💡 If a route or timing is not shown for your area, ask at the bus stand or a trusted person.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Android phone. Menu names can differ a little on your phone.)\n\n1️⃣ Open Google Maps\n✅ Tap the Google Maps app.\n\n2️⃣ Search for Help\n📱 In the search bar type: “hospital near me” or “pharmacy near me”\n\n3️⃣ Choose a Place\n✅ Tap a place in the list to see how far it is and how to reach it.\n\n4️⃣ For Buses\n✅ Type where you want to go.\n✅ Tap the bus icon to see routes and timings, where available.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Gill's Night Search\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nIt is late at night, and Mrs. Gill needs a chemist nearby.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Open Google Maps\n☐ Type “pharmacy near me”\n☐ Choose a place from the list\n☐ Wait until morning\n☐ Knock on every door in the colony\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Open Google Maps\n✅ Type “pharmacy near me”\n✅ Choose a place from the list\n❌ Waiting can make things worse when someone is unwell\n❌ Knocking on every door is not needed when Maps can help\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Pathfinder Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ You find a hospital or chemist quickly\n✅ You do not have to ask strangers in a new area\n✅ You can plan a bus journey with routes and timings\n✅ You feel more confident going to new places\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nIf someone at home felt unwell tonight, would you know the nearest hospital or chemist? How could you check?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
