     "title": "Story 2.5 · 📧 Your Digital Address",
     "description": "✨ One Gmail account opens school forms, class links and much more.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Form from the School\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Hegde\n\n👵 Mrs. Hegde is 65 years old and lives in Mangaluru. Her grandson Pranav is in Class 7.\n\nOne day Pranav's school sends a message: *“Please fill this Google Form for the science competition.”*\nMrs. Hegde has no email address, so she cannot sign in.\nShe has to wait for Pranav's parents to come home, and the last date is near.\n\nShe feels left out. *“Everything seems to need an email address these days.”*\n\nHer daughter helps her create a Gmail account.\n\n📱 Her phone can now, with one account:\n• Send and receive emails\n• Let her fill in Google Forms sent by a school or office\n• Let her join a Google Classroom with the class code a teacher gives\n\nShe opens the Gmail app and taps Create account.\nThat evening, she fills in the Google Form herself.\n\n*“Now I have my own digital address,”* she says proudly.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If a Class or Office Asks You to Join?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Sawant, 68, wants to join a free online computer class.\nThe teacher gives him a class code.\n\nWith his Gmail account he joins Google Classroom using that code.\n\n💡 Never share your Gmail password. A teacher or office never needs it.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Android phone. Menu names can differ a little on your phone.)\n\n1️⃣ Open Gmail\n✅ Open the Gmail app.\n\n2️⃣ Create Your Account\n📱 Tap Create account.\n✅ Follow the steps and choose a name for your email address.\n\n3️⃣ Fill In a Google Form\n✅ When a school or office sends a Google Form link, tap it and fill it in.\n\n4️⃣ Join a Google Classroom\n✅ Open Google Classroom and tap to join.\n✅ Type the class code your teacher gives you.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Hegde's Form\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nA school has sent Mrs. Hegde a Google Form, and she wants to fill it in herself.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat does she need to do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Create a Gmail account (Create account in the Gmail app)\n☐ Tap the Google Form link the school sent\n☐ Fill it in and send it\n☐ Share her Gmail password with the school\n☐ Wait for someone else to fill it for her\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Create a Gmail account (Create account in the Gmail app)\n✅ Tap the Google Form link the school sent\n✅ Fill it in and send it\n❌ A school never needs your password\n❌ Waiting means missing the last date\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Gmail Starter Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ You can fill in forms sent by schools and offices\n✅ You can join online classes with a class code\n✅ You can send and receive emails\n✅ You feel included, not left out\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhat is one form, class or message you could not take part in because you had no email address?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
