     "title": "Story 2.6 · 🗣️ Just Ask Out Loud",
     "description": "✨ Ask Google anything by voice, in Hindi, Marathi or English.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Question I Could Not Type\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Kamble\n\n👴 Mr. Kamble is 72 years old and lives in Kolhapur. He worked in a sugar factory, and he speaks only Marathi.\n\nHis grandson asked him: *“Ajoba, what is the weather going to be tomorrow? Shall we plan the picnic?”*\n\nMr. Kamble wants to find out. But typing on the phone is slow for him, and the keyboard is mostly in English.\nHis fingers are stiff, and he makes many mistakes. He gives up.\n\nThen his granddaughter shows him the microphone in the Google app.\n\n📱 His phone can:\n• Listen when he speaks\n• Understand Hindi, Marathi or English\n• Show the answer, in his language when it is set that way\n\nHe taps the microphone and says, in Marathi, what he wants to know about tomorrow's weather.\nThe answer appears.\n\n*“I just spoke, and the phone understood!”* he says with wide eyes.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If Your Hands Are Busy or Your Fingers Hurt?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Pawar, 69, has pain in her fingers. Today she is cooking.\nShe wants to know how long to boil an egg.\n\nShe taps the microphone and asks in Hindi.\nShe gets the answer without touching the keyboard.\n\n💡 To get the results in your own language, choose it in the Google app's Settings. A family member can help you do it once.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Android phone. Menu names can differ a little on your phone.)\n\n1️⃣ Open the Google App\n✅ Open the Google app.\n\n2️⃣ Tap the Microphone\n📱 Tap the microphone in the search bar.\n\n3️⃣ Speak\n✅ Speak clearly in Hindi, Marathi or English.\n✅ Ask your question in a quiet place.\n\n4️⃣ Choose Your Language for Results\n📱 Open the Google app's Settings.\n✅ Choose your language to get results in it.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mr. Kamble's Weather Question\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Kamble wants to ask Google about tomorrow's weather, but typing is hard for him.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat can he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Open the Google app\n☐ Tap the microphone\n☐ Speak his question in Marathi\n☐ Choose his language in the Google app's Settings for results\n☐ Give up because typing is hard\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Open the Google app\n✅ Tap the microphone\n✅ Speak his question in Marathi\n✅ Choose his language in the Google app's Settings for results\n❌ Giving up is not needed, because the phone listens\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Voice Searcher Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ You can ask questions without typing\n✅ You can speak in the language you are most comfortable with\n✅ You can search even when your fingers hurt or your hands are busy\n✅ You get answers quickly\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhat is one thing you have always wanted to find out, but never asked because typing was hard?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
    }
