     "title": "Story 3.1 · 📍 Walk Home Together",
     "description": "✨ Let your family follow you on the map until you reach home.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Evening After the Temple\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Rao\n\n👵 Mrs. Rao is 64 years old and lives in Bengaluru. Every Thursday she walks to the temple in the evening.\n\nThe walk home is short, but in winter it gets dark early.\nHer daughter Kavya, who works late, worries every Thursday.\n*“Amma, call me when you reach home,”* she says. But Mrs. Rao often forgets.\n\nLast week, Kavya called six times while her mother was in the temple, and she was very anxious.\n\nThen Kavya shows her mother live location in WhatsApp.\n\n📱 Her phone can:\n• Share where she is, live, on a map\n• Let her family follow her until she reaches home\n• Stop on its own after the time she chooses\n\nMrs. Rao opens her chat with Kavya, taps 📎 → Location → Share live location, and chooses 1 hour.\nKavya watches the small dot move along the map, from the temple to the gate.\n\n*“Reached,”* Kavya smiles, without making a single call.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Are Taking an Auto or Taxi Alone?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Sharma, 68, takes an auto home from the railway station at night.\nHis son is worried.\n\nBefore leaving, he shares his live location with his son for the length of the ride.\nHis son can see him moving along the road, and both feel at ease.\n\n💡 Share your live location only with family and people you trust. You choose how long to share.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(WhatsApp on Android and iPhone. Menu names can differ a little on your phone.)\n\n1️⃣ Open a WhatsApp Chat\n✅ Open the chat of a family member you trust.\n\n2️⃣ Tap the Attach Icon\n📱 Tap 📎.\n\n3️⃣ Share Live Location\n📱 Tap Location → Share live location.\n\n4️⃣ Choose How Long\n✅ Choose how long to share, for example 1 hour.\n✅ Your family can follow you on the map until you reach home.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Rao's Thursday Walk\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Rao is walking home from the temple in the evening. Her daughter wants to know she is safe.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Open the chat with her daughter\n☐ Tap 📎 → Location → Share live location\n☐ Choose how long to share, for example 1 hour\n☐ Share her live location in a large public group\n☐ Turn off the phone\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Open the chat with her daughter\n✅ Tap 📎 → Location → Share live location\n✅ Choose how long to share, for example 1 hour\n❌ A large public group should never see where you are\n❌ A switched-off phone cannot share anything\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Safe Traveller Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ Your family can see you are safe, without many calls\n✅ You choose who sees your location and for how long\n✅ You feel safer walking or travelling alone\n✅ Your family worries less\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich family member would you most like to share your live location with when you travel alone?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
    },
    {
     "title": "Story 3.2 · 💾 Memories That Never Vanish",
     "description": "✨ Back up your WhatsApp chats and photos, so a lost phone does not mean lost memories.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Phone Left on the Train\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Mehta\n\n👴 Mr. Mehta is 68 years old and lives in Surat. His phone holds years of family photos: his late wife, his grandchildren, the pilgrimage they made together.\n\nOne day on a train, his phone slips out of his pocket and is gone.\n\nHe is heartbroken. It is not the phone he mourns. It is the photos and the family chats.\n\n*“Everything is gone,”* he tells his son.\n\nHis son says: *“Papa, I have turned on your backup. Many of your photos and chats are safe.”*\nMonths ago, he had set it up on Mr. Mehta's phone.\n\n📱 The backup:\n• Saves his WhatsApp chats every day to Google Drive\n• Saves his photos in Google Photos\n• Keeps them safe, even if the phone is lost\n\nOn his new phone, Mr. Mehta signs in, and his photos and chats come back.\n\n*“Thank you for keeping my memories safe,”* he says, with tears of joy.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If Your Phone Breaks or Gets Stolen?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Desai's phone falls in a bucket of water and stops working.\nShe is not worried, because she turned on her backup.\n\nOn a new phone, she gets her chats and photos again.\n\n💡 Backup needs some internet and some storage space. A family member can check it with you once in a while.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Android phone. On iPhone, WhatsApp backs up to iCloud. Menu names can differ a little on your phone.)\n\n1️⃣ Back Up WhatsApp\n📱 Open WhatsApp: Settings → Chats → Chat backup\n\n2️⃣ Turn On Daily Backup\n✅ Choose a daily backup to Google Drive.\n✅ iPhone: choose iCloud.\n\n3️⃣ Back Up Your Photos\n📱 Open the Google Photos app.\n✅ Turn on backup.\n\n4️⃣ Check Now and Then\n✅ Ask a family member to look at your backup once in a while.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mr. Mehta's Memories\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Mehta wants his chats and photos to be safe, even if his phone is lost.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ In WhatsApp, open Settings → Chats → Chat backup\n☐ Turn on a daily backup to Google Drive\n☐ Turn on backup in Google Photos\n☐ Delete his photos so nothing can be lost\n☐ Hope the phone is never lost\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ In WhatsApp, open Settings → Chats → Chat backup\n✅ Turn on a daily backup to Google Drive\n✅ Turn on backup in Google Photos\n❌ Deleting photos loses the memories on purpose\n❌ Hoping is not a plan, and phones do get lost\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Memory Keeper Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ Your photos and chats stay safe if the phone is lost\n✅ A new phone is easy to fill with your old memories\n✅ You do not lose family moments\n✅ You feel calm about your phone\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich photo or chat on your phone would you hate to lose? Is it backed up today?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
