     "title": "Story 4.3 · 🎭 The Secret Family Word",
     "description": "✨ Scammers can copy a voice. A secret code word keeps your family safe.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"Dadaji, I Am in Trouble\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Qureshi\n\n👴 Mr. Qureshi is 73 years old and lives in Bhopal. His grandson Zayan studies in another city.\n\nOne evening, his phone rings.\nA voice that sounds exactly like Zayan says, in a panic: *“Dadaji, I am in trouble. I need ₹20,000 right now. Please do not tell Papa.”*\n\nMr. Qureshi's heart races. It is Zayan's voice. He is about to send the money.\n\nBut then he remembers: last Eid, the whole family agreed on a secret code word.\n\n📱 What he knows:\n• Scammers can copy a voice using AI\n• A code word that only the family knows proves who is calling\n• If the person cannot say it, hang up\n\nHe asks: *“Zayan, what is our family word?”*\nThe voice hesitates. Then the call cuts.\n\nMr. Qureshi hangs up and calls Zayan on the number he knows.\nZayan answers, fine and surprised. *“Dadaji, I never called you!”*\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If the “Relative” Is Crying and Rushing You?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Dsouza, 66, gets a call from a “nephew” who is crying and says he has had an accident.\nHe asks her to send money immediately.\n\nCrying and rushing are part of the trick. Scammers want you not to think.\n\nShe says: *“I will call you back.”* She hangs up and calls her nephew on his own number. He is safe.\n\n💡 If a “relative” calls asking for money urgently, ask for the family word, or hang up and call them back on the number you know.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Choose a Word Together\n✅ Sit with your family and agree on a secret code word.\n✅ Pick something easy for you but hard to guess.\n\n2️⃣ Say It, Do Not Post It\n✅ Tell it in person or on a call.\n✅ Never write it in a group, a message or a post.\n\n3️⃣ Use It\n✅ If a “relative” asks for money urgently, ask for the word.\n\n4️⃣ Or Call Back\n✅ If they cannot say it, hang up and call them on the number you know.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mr. Qureshi's Phone Call\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nA call sounds exactly like Mr. Qureshi's grandson and asks for money urgently.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Ask for the family code word\n☐ Hang up and call his grandson on the number he knows\n☐ Stay calm, and not send money in a hurry\n☐ Send the money because it sounds like Zayan\n☐ Write the family code word in a big group\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Ask for the family code word\n✅ Hang up and call his grandson on the number he knows\n✅ Stay calm, and not send money in a hurry\n❌ A copied voice can sound exactly like a relative\n❌ The code word must stay secret, so never post it\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Family Code Keeper Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes with your family:\n\n✅ You can tell a real relative from a fake voice\n✅ You do not send money to scammers\n✅ Your whole family becomes harder to fool\n✅ You feel safe and in control\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich family word could only your family know? When will you all sit down to choose it?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
