     "title": "Story 4.4 · 📲 Only From the Store",
     "description": "✨ Install apps only from the Play Store or App Store, never from a link.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Free Subsidy App\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Fernandes\n\n👵 Mrs. Fernandes is 64 years old and lives in Margao, Goa. She is careful with money.\n\nOne morning, a message arrives on WhatsApp from an unknown number:\n“Get your government electricity subsidy now! Download our app. Tap the file below.”\n\nBelow it is a file ending in .apk.\n\nShe loves the idea of saving money. Her thumb hovers over the file.\n\nThen she remembers her lesson: “An .apk file sent on WhatsApp or SMS can take over your phone and your bank account.”\n\n📱 She remembers:\n• Install apps only from the Play Store or App Store\n• A file ending in .apk, sent on WhatsApp or SMS, is dangerous\n• Never open one\n\nShe does not open it. She deletes the message.\n\nLater, she asks her son to check the electricity board's real app in the Play Store.\n*“If it is real, it will be there,”* she says.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If a Friend Sends the File?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Pinto, 69, receives an .apk file from a friend's number.\nHe thinks, *“My friend would not send anything bad.”*\n\nBut the friend's phone may have been taken over. A message from a known number can still be a trap.\n\nHe does not open it. He calls his friend, who is surprised.\n\n💡 Even if it comes from someone you know, do not open an .apk file.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Install Apps Safely\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Open the Store\n📱 Open the Play Store (Android) or the App Store (iPhone).\n\n2️⃣ Search for the App\n✅ Type the name of the app.\n✅ Choose the one made by the real company.\n\n3️⃣ Install\n✅ Tap Install.\n\n4️⃣ Never Open Files From Links\n✅ Never open an .apk file sent on WhatsApp or SMS.\n✅ If in doubt, ask a family member.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Fernandes's Message\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nA WhatsApp message offers a “subsidy app” as an .apk file.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should Mrs. Fernandes do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Not open the file\n☐ Delete the message\n☐ Install apps only from the Play Store or App Store\n☐ Ask a family member if she is in doubt\n☐ Tap the file to try the “free subsidy”\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Not open the file\n✅ Delete the message\n✅ Install apps only from the Play Store or App Store\n✅ Ask a family member if she is in doubt\n❌ An .apk file from a message can take over your phone and bank account\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Store-Safe Installer Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ Your phone stays safe from harmful apps\n✅ Your bank account stays safe\n✅ You know where real apps come from\n✅ You feel confident saying “no” to tempting messages\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nHave you ever been tempted by a free offer in a message? How will you handle the next one?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
