     "title": "Story 4.6 · 🔐 The Double Lock",
     "description": "✨ Two-step verification gives your WhatsApp and Gmail a second lock.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Code I Never Asked For\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Awasthi\n\n👵 Mrs. Awasthi is 66 years old and lives in Kanpur. She loves chatting with her sisters on WhatsApp.\n\nOne day, a stranger calls her: *“Madam, I am sending you a code. Please tell it to me, it is for your safety.”*\nA code does arrive on her phone.\n\nShe nearly reads it out. But her niece Ritu had warned her: *“Aunty, a code is like the key of your house. Never give it to anyone.”*\n\nShe does not share it. The caller hangs up.\n\nThat evening, Ritu sits with her and adds a second lock to her WhatsApp and Gmail.\n\n📱 The second lock:\n• WhatsApp: a 6-digit PIN that only she knows\n• Gmail: 2-Step Verification\n• Even if someone learns her password or her code, they still cannot get in without the second lock\n\nMrs. Awasthi sets her own PIN, and writes it on a paper that goes in her cupboard at home.\n\n*“Now my chats have a double lock,”* she says.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If Someone Asks for Your PIN or Code?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Gupta, 70, gets a message: *“Please send the 6-digit PIN from WhatsApp to continue.”*\n\nNo genuine person or company will ask for it.\n\nHe does not reply. He tells his son.\n\n💡 Never share your PIN or any code that arrives on your phone, with anyone, even if they say they are from a company or a bank.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Menu names can differ a little on your phone.)\n\n1️⃣ WhatsApp Two-Step Verification\n📱 Open: WhatsApp → Settings → Account → Two-step verification\n\n2️⃣ Turn It On\n✅ Tap Turn on.\n✅ Set a 6-digit PIN that you will remember.\n\n3️⃣ Gmail 2-Step Verification\n📱 Open: Google Account → Security → 2-Step Verification\n✅ Follow the steps to turn it on.\n\n4️⃣ Keep Your PIN Secret\n✅ Write your PIN on paper and keep it safe at home.\n✅ Never tell it to anyone.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Awasthi's Second Lock\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Awasthi wants to protect her WhatsApp and Gmail with a second lock.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Turn on two-step verification in WhatsApp\n☐ Set a 6-digit PIN she will remember\n☐ Turn on 2-Step Verification in her Google Account\n☐ Keep the PIN secret\n☐ Tell her PIN to a caller who says it is for her safety\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Turn on two-step verification in WhatsApp\n✅ Set a 6-digit PIN she will remember\n✅ Turn on 2-Step Verification in her Google Account\n✅ Keep the PIN secret\n❌ Never tell your PIN or a code to a caller\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Double Lock Pro Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on these settings:\n\n✅ Your WhatsApp and Gmail have a second lock\n✅ A stolen password alone cannot open them\n✅ Your chats and emails stay private\n✅ You feel safer and more in control\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich account would hurt most if a stranger got into it? Will you lock it twice today?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
