     "title": "Story 5.1 · 💳 Read Before You Pay",
     "description": "✨ After scanning a QR code, check the name and the amount before you enter your PIN.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Name on the Screen\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Lal\n\n👵 Mrs. Lal is 63 years old and lives in Chandigarh. She buys vegetables from the same vendor every morning.\n\nOne morning, she scans the vendor's QR code with her UPI app.\nShe is chatting and about to type her PIN, as she always does.\n\nThen she remembers a tip: “After scanning, read the name on the screen.”\n\n📱 What she checks:\n• The name that appears on the screen: is it the shop or person she expects?\n• The amount: is it right?\n• Only then does she enter her PIN\n\nShe reads the screen. The vendor's name is *Ram Kumar.* But the screen shows a different name.\n\nShe cancels and asks the vendor.\nHe smiles: *“Madam, someone has stuck a different QR code over mine!”*\n\nShe pays the right QR, safely. *“A few seconds of reading saved my money,”* she says.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If the Amount Is Wrong?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Bajaj, 68, scans a QR code at a medical shop.\nThe shopkeeper said ₹250, but the screen shows ₹2,500.\n\nHe checks the amount before entering his PIN, and cancels.\nA small slip, caught in time.\n\n💡 If the name or the amount does not match, cancel, and ask the shopkeeper.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Pay Safely\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Scan the QR Code\n✅ Scan the shop's QR code with your UPI app.\n\n2️⃣ Read the Name\n✅ Read the name that appears on the screen.\n✅ Is it the shop or person you expect?\n\n3️⃣ Check the Amount\n✅ Check that the amount is right.\n\n4️⃣ Enter Your PIN, or Cancel\n✅ If everything matches, enter your PIN.\n✅ If not, cancel.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Lal's Vegetables\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Lal scans a QR code, and the name on the screen is not the vendor's.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Read the name on the screen\n☐ Check the amount\n☐ Cancel if the name does not match\n☐ Ask the shopkeeper\n☐ Enter her PIN without looking\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Read the name on the screen\n✅ Check the amount\n✅ Cancel if the name does not match\n✅ Ask the shopkeeper\n❌ Never enter your PIN without checking\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Careful Payer Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ You do not pay the wrong person\n✅ You catch wrong amounts in time\n✅ Your money stays safe\n✅ You feel confident paying by QR\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhen you last paid by QR, did you read the name and the amount first?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
