     "title": "Story 5.2 · 🔴 No PIN to Receive",
     "description": "✨ Your UPI PIN is only for sending money. Nobody needs it to give you money.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Buyer for the Old Fridge\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Dutta\n\n👴 Mr. Dutta is 67 years old and lives in Guwahati. He wants to sell his old fridge online.\n\nA buyer replies quickly: *“I will pay ₹8,000. Scan this code and enter your UPI PIN to receive the payment.”*\n\nMr. Dutta is excited. He is about to scan.\n\nThen he remembers a rule from his class: “Your UPI PIN is only for sending money.”\n\n📱 What he remembers:\n• To receive money, you never need your PIN\n• If anyone asks you to enter your PIN or scan a code to “receive” money, it is a scam\n• Your PIN is a secret\n\nHe does not scan. He writes back: *“I do not enter my PIN to receive money.”*\n\nThe buyer vanishes.\n\n*“If it were real, the money would come without my PIN,”* he tells his wife.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If the Buyer Insists and Pressures You?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Nair, 64, is selling an old sewing machine.\nA buyer says: *“Please hurry, I am travelling. Just enter your PIN to confirm.”*\n\nPressure and hurry are part of the trick.\n\nShe says no, and blocks the number.\n\n💡 Receiving money is easy: you share your UPI ID or QR code. You never enter a PIN for it.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ The Rule — Step by Step\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Remember What the PIN Is For\n✅ Your UPI PIN is only for sending money.\n\n2️⃣ Never Enter It to Receive\n✅ Nobody needs your PIN to give you money.\n\n3️⃣ Never Scan to “Receive”\n✅ If someone asks you to scan a code to receive money, do not.\n\n4️⃣ Say No and Tell Someone\n✅ Say no, block the number, and tell your family.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mr. Dutta's Fridge\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nA buyer asks Mr. Dutta to scan a code and enter his UPI PIN to “receive” ₹8,000.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Not scan the code\n☐ Not enter his PIN\n☐ Say no and block the buyer\n☐ Tell his family\n☐ Enter his PIN to get the money\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Not scan the code\n✅ Not enter his PIN\n✅ Say no and block the buyer\n✅ Tell his family\n❌ You never need a PIN to receive money\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 PIN Protector Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ You know the one rule that stops many UPI scams\n✅ You do not lose money to “receive” tricks\n✅ Your PIN stays secret\n✅ You can sell and buy online with confidence\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nCan you say, in one sentence, what your UPI PIN is for?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
