     "title": "Story 5.3 · ⚡ Tea in One Tap",
     "description": "✨ Pay small amounts, like tea or vegetables, with one tap and no PIN.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Morning Tea Stall\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Rathod\n\n👴 Mr. Rathod is 70 years old and lives in Ahmedabad. Every morning he buys tea at the corner stall, and on the way back, vegetables.\n\nHe pays by UPI each time.\nEvery payment means: open the app, scan, type the amount, enter the PIN.\nHis fingers are slow, and a line forms behind him at the tea stall.\n\n*“It is only ₹10 for tea. Why so many steps?”* he mutters.\n\nHis son tells him about UPI Lite.\n\n📱 UPI Lite:\n• You add a small balance to it\n• Small payments, like tea or vegetables, go through with one tap\n• No PIN is needed for these small payments\n\nMr. Rathod turns on UPI Lite in his UPI app and adds a small balance.\n\nThe next morning, he taps once at the tea stall. The payment is done.\n*“Faster than counting coins,”* he smiles.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Run Out of the Balance?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Parmar, 66, uses UPI Lite for her daily small buys.\nOne day, her small balance runs out.\n\nShe simply adds a little more to UPI Lite. For bigger payments, she pays the normal way, with her PIN.\n\n💡 Keep only a small balance in UPI Lite, enough for small daily payments.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Menu names can differ a little in different UPI apps.)\n\n1️⃣ Open Your UPI App\n✅ Open the UPI app you already use.\n\n2️⃣ Turn On UPI Lite\n📱 Find UPI Lite and turn it on.\n\n3️⃣ Add a Small Balance\n✅ Add a small balance.\n\n4️⃣ Pay Small Amounts\n✅ Small payments, like tea or vegetables, now go through with one tap, without entering your PIN.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mr. Rathod's Tea\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Rathod wants to pay for tea and vegetables quickly, without typing his PIN every time.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Turn on UPI Lite in his UPI app\n☐ Add a small balance\n☐ Use it for small payments like tea and vegetables\n☐ Add a very large balance to UPI Lite\n☐ Tell the tea seller his PIN\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Turn on UPI Lite in his UPI app\n✅ Add a small balance\n✅ Use it for small payments like tea and vegetables\n❌ UPI Lite is for small payments, so keep the balance small\n❌ Never tell anyone your PIN\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 One-Tap Payer Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on this setting:\n\n✅ Small payments take one tap\n✅ No long lines behind you\n✅ You do not type your PIN again and again\n✅ You still pay the normal way for big amounts\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhat small payments do you make every day? Which of them could be done with one tap?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
