     "title": "Story 5.4 · 🔄 Bills That Pay Themselves",
     "description": "✨ Set up AutoPay for electricity, gas and mobile bills, and never be late again.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Late Fee Again\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Srinivasan\n\n👵 Mrs. Srinivasan is 66 years old and lives in Coimbatore. She manages the household bills: electricity, gas and mobile.\n\nEvery month she must remember the dates.\nThis month, her sister's wedding keeps her busy, and the electricity bill date goes by.\nA late fee is added. *“Again!”* she sighs.\n\nHer daughter says: *“Amma, let the phone pay on time.”*\n\n📱 With AutoPay:\n• Your bill is paid on time, automatically\n• You get a message before each payment\n• You can stop it any time\n\nIn her UPI app she opens Bills & recharges, chooses her electricity bill and turns on AutoPay.\n\nThe next month, she gets a message before the payment, and the bill is paid on time.\nNo late fee.\n\n*“I feel like I have a helper who never forgets,”* she says.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Want to Stop It?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Menon, 69, sets up AutoPay for his mobile bill.\nLater, he changes his plan and wants to stop it.\n\nHe can stop AutoPay any time. He gets a message before each payment, so there are no surprises.\n\n💡 Read the message you get before each payment, so you always know what is being paid.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Menu names can differ a little in different UPI apps.)\n\n1️⃣ Open Your UPI App\n✅ Open the UPI app you use.\n\n2️⃣ Open Bills & Recharges\n📱 Open Bills & recharges.\n\n3️⃣ Choose the Bill\n✅ Choose the bill, such as electricity, gas or mobile.\n\n4️⃣ Turn On AutoPay\n✅ Turn on AutoPay.\n✅ You get a message before each payment, and you can stop it any time.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Srinivasan's Bills\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Srinivasan keeps paying late fees because she forgets bill dates.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Open Bills & recharges in her UPI app\n☐ Choose the bill\n☐ Turn on AutoPay\n☐ Read the message before each payment\n☐ Stop paying her bills\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Open Bills & recharges in her UPI app\n✅ Choose the bill\n✅ Turn on AutoPay\n✅ Read the message before each payment\n❌ Not paying bills means penalties\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Bill Boss Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on this setting:\n\n✅ Bills are paid on time, with no late fees\n✅ You do not have to remember dates\n✅ You get a message before each payment\n✅ You can stop it any time\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich bill do you most often forget? Would you like it to pay itself?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
