    {
     "title": "Story 5.5 · 👪 Trusted Hands, Safe Limits",
     "description": "✨ Let a trusted family member pay from your UPI, up to a limit you set.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"When Papa Was Unwell\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Kapoor\n\n👴 Mr. Kapoor is 75 years old and lives in Delhi. His knees hurt, and he rarely leaves the house.\n\nWhen he runs out of medicines, he asks his son Varun to buy them.\nVarun pays from his own account, and Mr. Kapoor pays him back later.\n\nIt works, but he feels awkward. *“Why should he pay for me?”*\nAnd he worries: if he gave his son his own UPI details, what if there were a mistake?\n\nVarun shows him UPI Circle.\n\n📱 With UPI Circle:\n• You add a trusted family member\n• You set a monthly limit\n• They can pay from your account, up to that limit\n• You can remove them any time\n\nMr. Kapoor adds Varun and sets a monthly limit.\n\nNow Varun pays for the medicines from his father's account, and nothing goes above the limit.\n*“I stay in control, and he helps,”* says Mr. Kapoor.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Want to Stop Sharing?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Bhatia, 70, adds her niece to UPI Circle while she is recovering from surgery.\nMonths later, she is well again.\n\nShe removes her niece from UPI Circle. She can do this any time.\n\n💡 Add only someone you fully trust, and choose a limit that feels comfortable.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Menu names can differ a little in different UPI apps.)\n\n1️⃣ Open UPI Circle\n✅ Open UPI Circle in your UPI app.\n\n2️⃣ Add a Trusted Person\n✅ Add a trusted family member.\n\n3️⃣ Set a Monthly Limit\n✅ Choose a monthly limit.\n✅ They can pay from your account only up to that limit.\n\n4️⃣ Remove Them Any Time\n✅ You can remove them whenever you like.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mr. Kapoor's Medicines\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Kapoor wants his son to pay for medicines from his account, with some control.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Add his son in UPI Circle\n☐ Set a monthly limit\n☐ Remove him whenever he wants\n☐ Tell his son his UPI PIN\n☐ Add a stranger who offered to help\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Add his son in UPI Circle\n✅ Set a monthly limit\n✅ Remove him whenever he wants\n❌ You do not have to share your PIN with UPI Circle\n❌ Only add someone you fully trust\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Trusted Circle Keeper Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on this setting:\n\n✅ A trusted family member can pay for you\n✅ You stay in control with a monthly limit\n✅ You can remove them any time\n✅ You do not have to go out when you are unwell\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich family member would you trust with a UPI Circle? What monthly limit would feel comfortable?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
