     "title": "Story 5.6 · 👴 Proof of Life, From Your Sofa",
     "description": "✨ Pensioners can submit the life certificate with a face scan, with no bank visit.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"November Without the Queue\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Bose\n\n👴 Mr. Bose is 78 years old and lives in Kolkata. He receives a pension, and every year he must prove that he is alive.\n\nEvery November he goes to the bank.\nHe stands in a long line, his knees ache, and the walk back feels very long.\nLast year, he returned home exhausted and ill.\n\n*“Must I do this every year?”* he asks his daughter.\n\nHis daughter says: *“Baba, you can do it from home. Just a face scan.”*\n\n📱 With the Jeevan Pramaan and AadhaarFaceRD apps:\n• A pensioner submits the life certificate from home\n• The phone camera scans the face\n• No bank visit is needed\n\nHis daughter helps him install the apps. He holds the phone in front of his face, and the camera scans it.\n\nA message says his life certificate has been submitted.\n*“No queue, no walking, and I did it from my sofa,”* he says in wonder.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Need Help the First Time?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Sen, 76, is nervous about the apps.\nHer grandson sits with her the first time.\n\nThe steps are simple, and next year she does it alone.\n\n💡 Always use the official apps, Jeevan Pramaan and AadhaarFaceRD, and never share your Aadhaar number or OTP with someone who calls you.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Do It\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Menu names can differ a little. Ask a family member to help you the first time.)\n\n1️⃣ Install the Official Apps\n✅ Install Jeevan Pramaan and AadhaarFaceRD from the Play Store.\n\n2️⃣ Open the Jeevan Pramaan App\n✅ Open it and follow the steps.\n\n3️⃣ Scan Your Face\n✅ Hold the phone camera in front of your face and scan.\n\n4️⃣ Submit\n✅ Submit your life certificate.\n✅ No bank visit is needed.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mr. Bose's November\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Bose finds it hard to go to the bank to submit his life certificate.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat can he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Install the Jeevan Pramaan and AadhaarFaceRD apps\n☐ Scan his face with the phone camera\n☐ Submit the life certificate from home\n☐ Ask a family member to help him the first time\n☐ Give his Aadhaar and OTP to a caller who offers to do it\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Install the Jeevan Pramaan and AadhaarFaceRD apps\n✅ Scan his face with the phone camera\n✅ Submit the life certificate from home\n✅ Ask a family member to help him the first time\n❌ Never give your Aadhaar or OTP to a caller\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Life Certificate Hero Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ No long queue at the bank\n✅ No tiring journey for a pensioner\n✅ You submit from the comfort of your home\n✅ Your pension continues without worry\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWho in your family could help you with this the first time?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
