     "title": "Story 5.7 · 🏥 Health Cover at 70",
     "description": "✨ Everyone aged 70 and above can get the Ayushman Vay Vandana card for free hospital treatment cover.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Worry About the Hospital Bill\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Shetty\n\n👵 Mrs. Shetty is 71 years old and lives in Udupi. She lives with her husband on a small pension.\n\nOne night, her husband has chest pain and she rushes him to a hospital.\nHe is treated, and he recovers.\nBut the thought of the bill kept her awake: *“What if it happens again? How will we pay?”*\n\nA neighbour tells her about the Ayushman Vay Vandana card.\n\n📱 Under Ayushman Bharat:\n• Everyone aged 70 and above can get the Ayushman Vay Vandana card\n• It gives free hospital treatment cover\n• You can apply in the Ayushman app, at beneficiary.nha.gov.in, or at a nearby hospital or CSC\n\nMrs. Shetty goes with her son to a nearby CSC and applies.\n\nWhen the card arrives, she keeps it safe with her papers.\n*“Now I sleep better,”* she tells her husband.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Are Not Sure You Are Eligible?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Hegde, 72, is not sure whether he qualifies.\n\nThe rule is simple: aged 70 and above.\nHe asks at the hospital help desk, and they check for him.\n\n💡 Always apply at the official places: the Ayushman app, beneficiary.nha.gov.in, or a nearby hospital or CSC. Never pay an agent who says you need to pay for the card.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Apply\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Ask a family member to help you the first time.)\n\n1️⃣ Check Your Age\n✅ Are you 70 or above? Then you can get the card.\n\n2️⃣ Choose a Place to Apply\n✅ The Ayushman app\n✅ beneficiary.nha.gov.in\n✅ A nearby hospital or CSC\n\n3️⃣ Apply\n✅ Follow the steps and apply for the Ayushman Vay Vandana card.\n\n4️⃣ Keep the Card Safe\n✅ Keep your card safely with your important papers.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Shetty's Card\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Shetty, 71, wants free hospital treatment cover.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Apply for the Ayushman Vay Vandana card\n☐ Apply at the Ayushman app, beneficiary.nha.gov.in, or a nearby hospital or CSC\n☐ Ask her son to help her the first time\n☐ Pay a stranger who promises a card\n☐ Ignore it because she is healthy today\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Apply for the Ayushman Vay Vandana card\n✅ Apply at the Ayushman app, beneficiary.nha.gov.in, or a nearby hospital or CSC\n✅ Ask her son to help her the first time\n❌ Never pay a stranger for the card\n❌ Illness can come any time, so being ready is wise\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Health Cover Champion Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ Free hospital treatment cover for people aged 70 and above\n✅ Less worry about hospital bills\n✅ A card to keep safely, ready for when you need it\n✅ Peace of mind for you and your family\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nDoes anyone in your family aged 70 or above still need this card? Who will help them apply?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
