     "title": "Story 5.8 · 📁 Your Pocket Locker",
     "description": "✨ Keep your Aadhaar, PAN and certificates safe in DigiLocker, accepted as valid.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Missing Papers\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Bhosale\n\n👵 Mrs. Bhosale is 64 years old and lives in Satara. She is applying for a new gas connection.\n\nThe office asks for her Aadhaar and PAN copies.\nShe searches the cupboard. The Aadhaar is there, but the PAN card has gone missing.\nShe turns the house upside down. Her son has to come home early to help her.\n\n*“Why do I keep losing papers?”* she says wearily.\n\nHer son shows her DigiLocker.\n\n📱 With DigiLocker:\n• Official copies of your Aadhaar, PAN, driving licence and certificates are kept there\n• They are accepted as valid\n• You sign in with your Aadhaar-linked mobile number\n• Use the app or digilocker.gov.in\n\nShe signs in with her Aadhaar-linked mobile number.\nHer Aadhaar and PAN appear on her phone.\n\nAt the office, she shows the official copy from her phone.\n*“Now my papers are always with me,”* she says.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Lose Your Phone or the Paper?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Jadhav, 70, loses his driving licence.\nBecause he saved it in DigiLocker, he still has the official copy.\n\nIf he loses his phone, he can sign in again on another phone with his Aadhaar-linked mobile number.\n\n💡 Sign in only on the official DigiLocker app or digilocker.gov.in. Never share your OTP with anyone.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Ask a family member to help you the first time.)\n\n1️⃣ Open DigiLocker\n✅ Open the DigiLocker app, or go to digilocker.gov.in.\n\n2️⃣ Sign In\n✅ Sign in with your Aadhaar-linked mobile number.\n\n3️⃣ Find Your Documents\n✅ Look for your Aadhaar, PAN, driving licence and certificates.\n\n4️⃣ Show When Needed\n✅ Show the official copy from your phone.\n✅ It is accepted as valid.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Bhosale's Papers\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Bhosale keeps losing her papers and wants official copies on her phone.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Install the DigiLocker app or use digilocker.gov.in\n☐ Sign in with her Aadhaar-linked mobile number\n☐ Keep official copies of her Aadhaar, PAN and certificates there\n☐ Send her Aadhaar photo to a family WhatsApp group\n☐ Share her OTP with a caller\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Install the DigiLocker app or use digilocker.gov.in\n✅ Sign in with her Aadhaar-linked mobile number\n✅ Keep official copies of her Aadhaar, PAN and certificates there\n❌ A big group is not a safe place for private papers\n❌ Never share your OTP with anyone\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Locker Keeper Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ Your important papers are always with you\n✅ Official copies are accepted as valid\n✅ Less searching in cupboards\n✅ Your papers stay safe, even if a paper is lost\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhich paper do you most often have to search for? Will you keep it in DigiLocker?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
