     "title": "Story 6.1 · 🗣️ Talk, Don't Type",
     "description": "✨ Speak to AI in Hindi or Marathi, and listen to the answer.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Question in Marathi\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Gaikwad\n\n👵 Mrs. Gaikwad is 69 years old and lives in Nanded. She reads and speaks Marathi and understands a little Hindi.\n\nHer grandchildren talk about “asking the AI” everything: recipes, stories, school work.\nShe feels left out. *“I cannot type in English. That is only for the young.”*\n\nOne evening, she wonders how to remove a stain from a silk saree.\nHer granddaughter Sakshi says: *“Aaji, just speak to it.”*\n\n📱 With an AI app like Gemini or ChatGPT:\n• She taps the microphone\n• She speaks in Marathi or Hindi\n• She asks it to reply in the same language\n• She listens to the answer\n\nShe opens the app, taps the microphone and asks in Marathi about the stain.\nShe adds: *“Please reply in Marathi.”*\n\nA clear answer is spoken back to her, in her own language.\n*“It is like talking to a knowledgeable neighbour,”* she says with a smile.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Cannot Read the Answer Easily?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Shinde, 71, has tired eyes and cannot read small letters.\nHe asks his question by voice and listens to the answer instead of reading it.\n\n💡 AI can make mistakes. For health or money, check important answers with a doctor, a bank or a family member.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Menu names can differ a little in different apps.)\n\n1️⃣ Open an AI App\n✅ Open the Gemini or ChatGPT app.\n\n2️⃣ Tap the Microphone\n📱 Tap the microphone.\n\n3️⃣ Speak in Your Language\n✅ Speak in Hindi or Marathi.\n\n4️⃣ Ask for a Reply in the Same Language\n✅ Ask it to reply in the same language.\n✅ Listen to the answer.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Gaikwad's Stain\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Gaikwad wants to ask an AI app a question in Marathi, without typing.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Open the Gemini or ChatGPT app\n☐ Tap the microphone\n☐ Speak her question in Marathi\n☐ Ask it to reply in Marathi, and listen\n☐ Give up because she cannot type in English\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Open the Gemini or ChatGPT app\n✅ Tap the microphone\n✅ Speak her question in Marathi\n✅ Ask it to reply in Marathi, and listen\n❌ There is no need to give up, because the app listens to her voice\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Voice Explorer Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ You can ask AI anything without typing\n✅ You can speak in the language you know best\n✅ You can listen to answers instead of reading\n✅ You no longer feel left out\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhat is one question you would love to ask an AI, in your own language?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
