    {
     "title": "Story 6.2 · 👪 A Guiding Hand",
     "description": "✨ Use Google Family Link to guide your child's phone: screen time, apps and location.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"Arjun's First Phone\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Pawar\n\n👩 Mrs. Pawar is 40 years old and lives in Thane. Her son Arjun is 10, and he has just been given his first phone for online classes.\n\nShe is happy for him, but she is also anxious.\n“How long is he on it? What apps is he downloading? Where is the phone when he goes to tuition?”\n\nConstant checking makes both of them irritable.\nArjun says: *“Mummy, you keep taking my phone!”*\n\nThen she learns about Google Family Link.\n\n📱 With Family Link, from her own phone she can:\n• Set screen-time limits\n• Approve the apps he downloads\n• See where the phone is\n\nShe installs Google Family Link on her phone and links Arjun's phone.\nShe sits down with Arjun and explains what each setting does, and why.\n\n“It is not to spy, Arjun. It is so that we both feel safe.”\nArjun nods. He even asks for a little more screen time on Sundays, and she agrees.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If a Child Wants to Download a New App?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nArjun wants a new game.\nOn his phone, the app waits for his mother's approval.\n\nMrs. Pawar looks at the app, asks him about it, and says yes.\n\n💡 Talk to your child. Family Link works best when children understand why the rules exist, and when the rules grow with their age.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Set It Up\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n(Ask a family member to help you the first time.)\n\n1️⃣ Install Family Link on Your Phone\n✅ Install Google Family Link on your phone (the parent's).\n\n2️⃣ Link Your Child's Phone\n✅ Follow the steps to link your child's phone.\n\n3️⃣ Set Limits and Approvals\n✅ Set screen-time limits.\n✅ Choose to approve the apps they download.\n\n4️⃣ Check and Talk\n✅ See where the phone is.\n✅ Talk to your child about the rules, and why you have them.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Pawar's Settings\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Pawar wants to guide her 10-year-old son's first phone.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat can Family Link help her do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Set screen-time limits\n☐ Approve the apps he downloads\n☐ See where the phone is\n☐ Explain to Arjun why the rules exist\n☐ Use it without ever telling him\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Set screen-time limits\n✅ Approve the apps he downloads\n✅ See where the phone is\n✅ Explain to Arjun why the rules exist\n❌ Children trust you more when they know what you are doing\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Guiding Parent Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes on this setting:\n\n✅ You know how long your child uses the phone\n✅ You approve the apps they download\n✅ You can see where the phone is\n✅ Fewer arguments, because the rules are clear\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhat screen-time limit would feel fair to both you and your child? Have you discussed it with them?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
