     "title": "Story 6.4 · 🙅 Keep It Private",
     "description": "✨ Never type your OTP, passwords, Aadhaar, bank details or family photos into an AI chat.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Helpful Chatbot\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mr. Tiwari\n\n👴 Mr. Tiwari is 66 years old and lives in Varanasi. He has recently started using an AI chat app, and he enjoys it.\n\nIt answers his questions about history and cricket politely.\nOne day, he gets a message from his bank about a failed payment and an OTP.\n\nHe thinks: *“The AI is so clever. Let me ask it to fix this.”*\nHe starts typing: *“I got this OTP 482…”*\n\nHis thumb stops. A line from his class comes to mind: “Treat an AI chat like talking to a stranger.”\n\n📱 What he remembers:\n• Never type your OTP, passwords, Aadhaar, bank details or family photos into an AI chat\n• An AI chat is like a stranger\n• Your bank is the only one to sort out bank problems\n\nHe deletes what he typed. He calls his bank instead, using the number on the back of his card.\n\n*“I almost handed my OTP to a machine,”* he tells his wife.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If the AI Asks for Your Details?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Rawat, 63, is chatting with an AI app, and it asks for her Aadhaar number “to help her better.”\n\nShe does not give it.\n\nA good question can be asked without private details, for example: *“How do I link my Aadhaar to my bank?”*\n\n💡 If any chat asks for private details, stop, and do not type them.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ The Rule — Step by Step\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Think Before You Type\n✅ Ask yourself: *“Is this private?”*\n\n2️⃣ Never Type These\n✅ OTP\n✅ Passwords\n✅ Aadhaar\n✅ Bank details\n✅ Family photos\n\n3️⃣ Ask Without Details\n✅ Ask your question in general words, with no private details.\n\n4️⃣ Treat It Like a Stranger\n✅ An AI chat is like talking to a stranger.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mr. Tiwari's Chat\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMr. Tiwari has an OTP from his bank, and he wonders whether to ask the AI app for help.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should he do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Not type the OTP into the AI chat\n☐ Call his bank directly\n☐ Ask the AI general questions without private details\n☐ Type his Aadhaar number to get better help\n☐ Upload a family photo to the AI chat\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Not type the OTP into the AI chat\n✅ Call his bank directly\n✅ Ask the AI general questions without private details\n❌ Never type your Aadhaar number into an AI chat\n❌ Never upload family photos to an AI chat\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Privacy Guard Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ Your OTP, passwords and bank details stay private\n✅ You can enjoy AI without worry\n✅ Your family photos stay with your family\n✅ You know the one question to ask: “Is this private?”\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhat is one private thing you will never type into an AI chat?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
