     "title": "Story 6.5 · 🕵️ Real or Fake?",
     "description": "✨ AI can make fake photos, videos and voices. Check before you forward.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Shocking Video\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Agarwal\n\n👵 Mrs. Agarwal is 63 years old and lives in Kota. She is a member of many family WhatsApp groups.\n\nOne morning, a video arrives in a group: a famous person says something shocking.\nEveryone is forwarding it, with “Share with everyone!”\n\nMrs. Agarwal's thumb is ready to forward.\n\nThen she remembers a lesson: “AI can make fake photos, videos and voices.”\n\n📱 She remembers:\n• AI can make fake photos, videos and voices\n• Look for odd hands or faces\n• Check trusted news websites\n• Do not share if you are not sure\n\nShe watches the video again, slowly.\nThe person's fingers look strange, and the lips do not match the voice.\n\nShe searches for the news on a trusted news website. There is nothing about it.\n\nShe does not forward it. She tells the group: *“I think this is fake.”*\nLater, others thank her.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If It Is a Voice Message From a “Relative”?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMr. Pillai, 68, gets a voice message that sounds like his nephew.\nIt asks for money urgently.\n\nAI can copy voices, too. He calls his nephew on his own number, and finds that it was not him.\n\n💡 When in doubt, do not share. It is better to stay quiet than to spread a lie.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Check Before You Forward\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Pause\n✅ Do not forward at once. Take a moment.\n\n2️⃣ Look Closely\n✅ Look for odd hands or faces.\n\n3️⃣ Check a Trusted Source\n✅ Check trusted news websites.\n\n4️⃣ Not Sure? Do Not Share\n✅ If you are not sure, do not share.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Agarwal's Forward\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nA shocking video is being forwarded in many groups.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should Mrs. Agarwal do before forwarding it? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Look for odd hands or faces\n☐ Check trusted news websites\n☐ Not share it if she is not sure\n☐ Forward it fast so she is first\n☐ Believe it because many people sent it\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Look for odd hands or faces\n✅ Check trusted news websites\n✅ Not share it if she is not sure\n❌ Forwarding quickly can spread a lie\n❌ Many people sending something does not make it true\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Fake Detector Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ You can spot signs of fake photos and videos\n✅ You do not spread false news\n✅ Your family trusts what you share\n✅ You help keep your community safe\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhen did you last forward something without checking? What will you do differently next time?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
