     "title": "Story 6.6 · 🍲 What's in the Kitchen?",
     "description": "✨ Tell AI what you have at home, and get simple recipes for a quick dinner.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 Story: \"The Empty Fridge Evening\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n👤 Meet Mrs. Dhawan\n\n👵 Mrs. Dhawan is 58 years old and lives in Delhi. Her husband will be home soon, hungry.\n\nShe opens the kitchen: rice, dal, one onion and a tomato.\nNothing fancy, and the shops are far.\n\n*“What can I make with this?”* she wonders, and she feels a little stressed.\n\nHer daughter says on the phone: *“Mummy, ask the AI.”*\n\n📱 With an AI app she can:\n• Tell it what she has\n• Ask for a quick dinner idea\n• Get simple recipes and steps\n\nShe opens the app and says:\n\n🎬 “I have rice, dal, onion and tomato. Suggest a quick dinner.”\n\nThe app suggests a simple tomato-onion dal with rice, with the steps one by one.\n\nIn half an hour, dinner is on the table.\n*“Simple, and tasty,”* her husband says.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🤔 What If You Have Allergies or Special Needs?\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nMrs. Menon, 64, cooks for a husband who must avoid certain foods.\nShe adds this to her question: *“No fried food, please.”*\n\nThe AI changes its suggestion to suit her.\n\n💡 AI suggestions are ideas. Use your own judgement about food, especially for health needs.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🛠️ How To Use It\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1️⃣ Look at What You Have\n✅ Check the kitchen: rice, dal, vegetables.\n\n2️⃣ Open an AI App\n✅ Open the Gemini or ChatGPT app.\n\n3️⃣ Tell It What You Have\n✅ Type or speak: “I have rice, dal, onion and tomato. Suggest a quick dinner.”\n\n4️⃣ Follow the Steps\n✅ Read or listen to the simple recipe and steps.\n✅ Add anything you need, like “no fried food.”\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎮 Interactive Activity: \"Mrs. Dhawan's Dinner\"\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎬 Scenario\nMrs. Dhawan has only rice, dal, an onion and a tomato at home.\n\n❓ Question\nWhat should she do? (Tick all that are correct.)\n\n☐ Open an AI app\n☐ Tell it what she has at home\n☐ Ask it to suggest a quick dinner\n☐ Follow the simple steps it gives\n☐ Type her bank details so the AI can order food\n\n🔑 Answer\n✅ Open an AI app\n✅ Tell it what she has at home\n✅ Ask it to suggest a quick dinner\n✅ Follow the simple steps it gives\n❌ Never type bank details into an AI chat\n\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n🏆 Kitchen Chef Badge Earned!\n🏆━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━🏆\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌟 Real-Life Benefits\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nAfter spending just a few minutes learning this:\n\n✅ You can cook a meal from what you already have\n✅ No need to rush to the shop\n✅ You discover new, simple recipes\n✅ Less stress at dinner time\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n💭 Reflection Question\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWhat is in your kitchen right now? What would you ask the AI to help you cook?\n\n🌟 Digital Saathi · Learn it · Try it · Stay safe"
